# /etc/inittab of midgard's Alpine image (busybox init, which midgard-init executes as
# PID 1 after it mounted the API file systems). OpenRC starts the services of the
# runlevels; then /etc/midgard/booted tells midgard-init that the guest booted
# (`ready = "notify"`).
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc sysinit
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc boot
::wait:/sbin/openrc default
::wait:/etc/midgard/booted
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/sbin/openrc shutdown
